# License and attribution

## This port

The Go sources in this repository are a reimplementation of the core chat path
of [deepmean/Qwen2API](https://github.com/deepmean/Qwen2API), which is itself a
fork of [Rfym21/Qwen2API](https://github.com/Rfym21/Qwen2API). The upstream
project declares `"license": "ISC"` in its `package.json`, though it ships no
`LICENSE` file.

`src/utils/cookie-generator.js` and `src/utils/fingerprint.js` upstream were
translated to Go in `ssxmod.go`. `src/utils/header-profile.js`,
`src/utils/token-manager.js`, `src/utils/sse.js`,
`src/utils/chat-helpers.js` and `src/middlewares/chat-middleware.js` informed
`qwen.go`, `sse.go` and `main.go`. No upstream file is copied verbatim.

Because the upstream project is ISC-licensed, this port is distributed under the
same terms:

